# Code owners auto-assigns reviewers for pull requests.
# https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Default owners for everything in the repo
*       @your-org/maintainers

# Backend (Python / FastAPI)
/backend/        @your-org/backend-reviewers
/backend/api/    @your-org/api-reviewers
/backend/analysis/  @your-org/analysis-reviewers
/config/         @your-org/backend-reviewers

# Frontend (HTML / static assets)
/frontend/       @your-org/frontend-reviewers

# Tests
/tests/          @your-org/qa-reviewers
/full_diagnose.py  @your-org/qa-reviewers

# Infrastructure
/Dockerfile      @your-org/devops-reviewers
/docker-compose.yml  @your-org/devops-reviewers
/.github/        @your-org/devops-reviewers
/Makefile        @your-org/devops-reviewers
/scripts/        @your-org/devops-reviewers

# Documentation
/docs/           @your-org/docs-reviewers
/README.md       @your-org/docs-reviewers
/CHANGELOG.md    @your-org/docs-reviewers
/ARCHITECTURE.md @your-org/architect-reviewers

# Security-sensitive files
/backend/api/routes/auth.py  @your-org/security-reviewers
/backend/security/  @your-org/security-reviewers
/.env.example    @your-org/security-reviewers
/SECURITY.md     @your-org/security-reviewers
